Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Every neural network, from ChatGPT to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,your photo app, is just matrix
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,multiplication hidden behind a few simple tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,An input is a vector of numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.23,0:00:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be pixels from an image,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,words turned into embeddings, or sensor readings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A matrix is a transformation of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,space. Each column tells you where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a basis vector lands after the warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiplying the input by W
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,warps it into a new
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,space where patterns become easier to separate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A bias vector shifts that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,space so the network does
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,not have to pass through the origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then ReLU clips negative values to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,zero. This simple fold is the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.51,0:00:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,nonlinearity that lets the network bend straight lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Another matrix maps the hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,state into output scores, one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,number for each possible class.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest score wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The network picks the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,class it is most confident about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,During training, small nudges to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,every weight and bias make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the predictions better, layer after layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow for the math behind AI.